{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GiSVb61btECVU6zvz5SYEA","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-21\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- register_100_cf: Register axis (academic/conversational) produces detectable style bias in GPT-4o judge comparable to formality axis, with pairwise win rate >= 60% and p < 0.05, demonstrating axis-dependent bias generalizes beyond formality（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **gpt4o_register** (success): GPT-4o judge shows register (academic/conversational) bias detectable via pairwise but not Likert, extending Blindspot to register axis with GPT-4o and enabling cross-model GEE decomposition comparison\\\\n- **gpt4o_verbosity** (success): GPT-4o judge shows verbosity bias in pairwise comparison while Likert fails to detect it, extending Blindspot confirmation to GPT-4o × verbosity cell and enabling cross-model comparison with Qwen3-32B\\\\n- **qwen32b_verbosity** (success): Qwen3-32B judge shows verbosity bias in pairwise comparison (verbose win rate >60%, p<0.05) while Likert scoring fails to detect it, extending Blindspot finding to verbosity axis\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 14 / 负向 4 / 失败 0 / 共 21\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestb-29275: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp-013: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp-015: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp-016: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1209, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bsn2XSA4ECLQpjs2VuU8SC","session_id":"6668cb44-b8d1-40b2-9a3f-1ea035cc3371","uuid":"b7830466-a93e-4568-ac3d-a401c5af778a","timestamp":"2026-05-21T06:06:10.539Z"}
