y analysis + bimodal distribution justification\"\n54\t        assigned_to: paper_agent\n55\t        status: done\n56\t    resolution: \"Threshold on plateau, not cliff edge. Results robust 0.70-0.95\"\n57\t    resolution_round: 1\n58\t\n59\t  - id: \"R2-N1\"\n60\t    summary: \"Novelty 不足——Likert Blindspot 是已知心理测量学现象在 LLM judge 的 domain transfer\"\n61\t    category: framing\n62\t    severity: critical\n63\t    status: in_progress\n64\t    first_raised_round: 1\n65\t    last_seen_round: 1\n66\t    mentions:\n67\t      - round: 1\n68\t        reviewers: [1, 2]\n69\t        note: \"R2 提出；R1 REBUT Findings-level 价值\"\n70\t    action_items:\n71\t      - round: 1\n72\t        action: \"6/6 Blindspot cells (4 strong + 2 marginal register)。GEE gradient 跨 judge 复现。但 novelty ceiling 结构性存在\"\n73\t        assigned_to: paper_agent\n74\t        status: in_progress\n75\t    resolution: \"\"\n76\t    resolution_round: null\n77\t\n78\t  - id: \"R2-N2\"\n79\t    summary: \"引用系统严重不完整——placeholder arXiv IDs、broken citations、总引用数偏少\"\n80\t    category: format\n81\t    severity: critical\n82\t    status: resolved\n83\t    first_raised_round: 1\n84\t    last_seen_round: 1\n85\t    mentions:\n86\t      - round: 1\n87\t        reviewers: [1, 2]\n88\t        note: \"R2 报告占位符；R1 AGREE\"\n89\t    action_items:\n90\t      - round: 1\n91\t        action: \"22 verified references。0 placeholder/broken。编译确认\"\n92\t        assigned_to: paper_agent\n93\t        status: done\n94\t    resolution: \"22 verified refs, 0 broken, 0 undefined references\"\n95\t    resolution_round: 1\n96\t\n97\t  - id: \"R2-N3\"\n98\t    summary: \"RATE 批评缺乏 matched replication——ecological validity 跨越\"\n99\t    category: framing\n100\t    severity: critical\n101\t    status: resolved\n102\t    first_raised_round: 1\n103\t    last_seen_round: 1\n104\t    mentions:\n105\t      - round: 1\n106\t        reviewers: [1, 2]\n107\t        note: \"R2 提出；R1 AGREE with nuance\"\n108\t    action_items:\n109\t      - round: 1\n110\t        action: \"同数据 h2h：Likert ATE p=0.33 vs BT 63.0% p<0.001。Complementary framing\"\n111\t        assigned_to: paper_agent\n112\t        status: done\n113\t    resolution: \"§likert_pairwise 直接 h2h on same data\"\n114\t    resolution_round: 1\n115\t\n116\t  - id: \"R1-W1\"\n117\t    summary: \"Likert baseline 可能不公平——未使用 ordinal regression\"\n118\t    category: method\n119\t    severity: critical\n120\t    status: resolved\n121\t    first_raised_round: 1\n122\t    last_seen_round: 1\n123\t    mentions:\n124\t      - round: 1\n125\t        reviewers: [1, 2]\n126\t        note: \"R1 提出；R2 升级为必要实验\"\n127\t    action_items:\n128\t      - round: 1\n129\t        action: \"exp-015 ordinal regression p=0.769。7-method sensitivity hierarchy\"\n130\t        assigned_to: paper_agent\n131\t        status: done\n132\t    resolution: \"Table 2: all 7 Likert methods fail. Blindspot is measurement-structural\"\n133\t    resolution_round: 1\n134\t\n135\t  - id: \"R1-W2\"\n136\t    summary: \"Consistency filtering ~40-50% data loss 未分析\"\n137\t    category: experiment\n138\t    severity: warning\n139\t    status: resolved\n140\t    first_raised_round: 1\n141\t    last_seen_round: 1\n142\t    mentions:\n143\t      - round: 1\n144\t        reviewers: [1, 2]\n145\t        note: \"R1 提出；R2 补充 win rate 可能被高估\"\n146\t    action_items:\n147\t      - round: 1\n148\t        action: \"BT 63.0% (all data) < sign test 73.9% (filtered) → no inflation\"\n149\t        assigned_to: paper_agent\n150\t        status: done"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bsn2XSA4ECLQpjs2VuU8SC","session_id":"6668cb44-b8d1-40b2-9a3f-1ea035cc3371","uuid":"ed641411-baf2-44d4-9404-7c8f5d2e1689","timestamp":"2026-05-21T06:07:39.799Z"}
